WEBVTT

00:00:00.980 --> 00:00:07.480
Previously on 
The Reflection

00:00:04.380 --> 00:00:06.360
If I'd stayed behind...

00:00:06.360 --> 00:00:08.850
If you'd stayed behind, 
you wouldn't be here now.

00:00:09.110 --> 00:00:11.860
But that doesn't mean there's 
no way to stop them.

00:00:12.190 --> 00:00:13.500
Will you be able to save them?

00:00:13.990 --> 00:00:15.030
I will!

00:00:15.030 --> 00:00:17.030
Miss Allen?

00:00:19.520 --> 00:00:21.480
Shall we swing?

00:00:37.170 --> 00:00:38.750
My bad.

00:00:40.250 --> 00:00:42.460
Are you Nina Fisher?

00:00:43.140 --> 00:00:44.760
You said that damn name again!

00:00:45.110 --> 00:00:48.090
Is she, by chance, your daughter?

00:00:48.090 --> 00:00:48.560
Hmph.

00:00:48.560 --> 00:00:51.830
She's a Reflected, just like us.

00:00:53.930 --> 00:00:54.830
What?

00:00:58.720 --> 00:00:59.820
Decoys?

00:01:02.630 --> 00:01:04.910
I am Wraith.

00:01:04.910 --> 00:01:07.620
The Reflected will become one.

00:01:07.620 --> 00:01:11.960
And for that to happen, we need you, as well.

00:01:13.480 --> 00:01:14.500
Mom...

00:01:15.080 --> 00:01:17.570
Well, I was alone for so long.

00:01:17.570 --> 00:01:19.180
Then you've finally become an adult.

00:01:26.390 --> 00:01:27.840
It's showtime!

00:03:05.920 --> 00:03:08.770
Uh... Is it not?

00:03:09.110 --> 00:03:11.640
No, it is.

00:03:11.640 --> 00:03:13.180
It's definitely showtime.

00:03:44.270 --> 00:03:45.820
My shop!

00:03:46.100 --> 00:03:47.010
Nina...

00:04:08.560 --> 00:04:12.320
You can only teleport a limited distance.

00:04:12.320 --> 00:04:14.670
I can predict where you'll turn up.

00:04:16.300 --> 00:04:17.850
Leave those two behind.

00:04:19.450 --> 00:04:21.920
Then I'll just burn you!

00:04:30.990 --> 00:04:32.940
Don't touch me!

00:04:55.270 --> 00:04:56.970
My flames...

00:04:57.780 --> 00:04:59.480
I hope I don't get burned.

00:05:28.790 --> 00:05:31.170
X-On! Sorry I'm late!

00:05:31.630 --> 00:05:33.180
I'll leave her to you!

00:05:33.840 --> 00:05:35.520
You piece of scrap...

00:05:35.520 --> 00:05:37.850
You think you can take me on?

00:05:40.670 --> 00:05:42.320
It's not metal?

00:05:42.730 --> 00:05:46.240
Imagination is more powerful than anything!

00:05:53.100 --> 00:05:54.900
Fly, Big Wheel!

00:06:06.050 --> 00:06:08.800
Don't think you can get away from me.

00:06:15.290 --> 00:06:17.000
Found you!

00:06:20.010 --> 00:06:21.940
Hey, it's been a while.

00:06:21.940 --> 00:06:23.340
You!

00:06:23.340 --> 00:06:26.780
Did you come to get your 
ass beat to a pulp again?

00:06:26.780 --> 00:06:28.060
What?!

00:06:28.060 --> 00:06:32.330
I'm not the same as I was before!

00:06:35.820 --> 00:06:37.620
Let's do this.

00:06:38.010 --> 00:06:42.130
You should be saying, 
"Thank you for fighting me again!"

00:06:42.430 --> 00:06:45.380
Aaron! Go all-out for me!

00:06:45.380 --> 00:06:46.920
We're working on it now.

00:06:46.920 --> 00:06:49.980
Hurry and get it over with, 
and get back here.

00:06:50.300 --> 00:06:52.160
I have something you'll enjoy.

00:06:52.160 --> 00:06:54.310
<i>I want to enjoy the present!</i>

00:06:54.820 --> 00:06:58.140
<i>Jay, Tim, Enrico! You guys ready?</i>

00:06:58.620 --> 00:07:00.420
Everything's ready here.

00:07:00.420 --> 00:07:03.600
One sec... Yeah, all set.

00:07:03.600 --> 00:07:05.990
All right, let's let loose!

00:07:07.480 --> 00:07:13.430
The shining sun, the sparkling sea, 
the piercing blue wind...

00:07:13.430 --> 00:07:15.310
Welcome to LA.

00:07:15.600 --> 00:07:17.870
And I am LA's special ambassador,

00:07:19.120 --> 00:07:20.170
I-Guy!

00:07:20.790 --> 00:07:24.750
"Sky Show"! I hope you enjoy 
the performance, Bat Kid!

00:07:24.750 --> 00:07:26.590
It's Dead Wing!

00:07:29.060 --> 00:07:32.450
I told you, I'm not the same as before.

00:07:32.450 --> 00:07:36.250
True... You've become even lamer.

00:08:50.860 --> 00:08:51.940
You're in my way.

00:09:09.620 --> 00:09:10.720
Run...

00:09:11.580 --> 00:09:12.390
Right.

00:09:18.950 --> 00:09:20.900
What? Why?

00:09:28.680 --> 00:09:32.120
Nina... Margaret...

00:09:32.470 --> 00:09:34.700
Mom, I'm scared!

00:09:34.700 --> 00:09:37.550
It's all right, Nina.

00:09:37.550 --> 00:09:38.510
Huh?

00:09:38.510 --> 00:09:39.760
Maggie?

00:09:40.100 --> 00:09:40.880
Mom!

00:09:45.000 --> 00:09:46.140
Maggie!

00:09:47.630 --> 00:09:48.710
Maggie?

00:09:52.280 --> 00:09:53.510
Maggie...

00:10:22.580 --> 00:10:23.770
Where'd he go?

00:10:38.290 --> 00:10:39.320
Maggie!

00:10:39.660 --> 00:10:41.440
What did you do to Maggie?

00:10:47.450 --> 00:10:49.180
Too bad about those two.

00:10:49.180 --> 00:10:52.360
But we should have just 
enough to move forward.

00:10:52.360 --> 00:10:55.390
Please move to the next step immediately.

00:10:55.390 --> 00:10:58.960
I can't accept this... We should 
take their lives, then!

00:10:58.960 --> 00:11:00.260
Why?

00:11:00.730 --> 00:11:03.260
What are you trying to do?

00:11:03.770 --> 00:11:05.320
Why would you do this?

00:11:05.320 --> 00:11:06.970
It's all for the plan.

00:11:07.320 --> 00:11:08.470
The plan?

00:11:08.800 --> 00:11:12.960
I am part of the plan, as are all of you.

00:11:13.340 --> 00:11:15.470
No one can escape.

00:11:27.940 --> 00:11:29.460
What is this plan?

00:11:32.900 --> 00:11:34.160
What is it?

00:11:48.250 --> 00:11:49.550
Hey, guys!

00:11:50.060 --> 00:11:51.800
You guys aren't bad.

00:11:52.810 --> 00:11:55.390
I'm sure you all know who I am.

00:11:55.870 --> 00:11:59.030
LA welcomes you all.

00:12:11.100 --> 00:12:13.330
What the... What the hell was that for?

00:12:14.310 --> 00:12:20.350
Since you caused such a ruckus, 
I couldn't back up Eleanor.

00:12:21.260 --> 00:12:23.330
I could have saved that family.

00:12:23.800 --> 00:12:24.960
What?

00:12:24.960 --> 00:12:26.720
This isn't the first time.

00:12:26.720 --> 00:12:29.970
You got cocky trying to play the hero.

00:12:30.350 --> 00:12:31.750
Play?

00:12:31.750 --> 00:12:35.740
I'm a true hero! A star!

00:12:36.190 --> 00:12:41.010
With my light, I have shone 
upon LA and defeated evil!

00:12:41.010 --> 00:12:42.660
You're basically a lighthouse.

00:12:42.660 --> 00:12:48.080
You're a mindless light that attracts 
and lures out those with abilities.

00:12:48.470 --> 00:12:51.990
Though, I guess they might 
consider you a hero.

00:12:52.440 --> 00:12:53.410
Shut up!

00:13:08.060 --> 00:13:09.100
Damn it.

00:13:13.120 --> 00:13:14.260
Eleanor...

00:13:22.630 --> 00:13:23.620
Hey.

00:13:42.920 --> 00:13:44.150
This is fine.

00:13:49.470 --> 00:13:51.910
There's nothing more I can do.

00:13:52.200 --> 00:13:55.670
Right now, all we can do is 
wait for their next move.

00:14:01.290 --> 00:14:02.830
What?

00:14:10.790 --> 00:14:12.020
What?

00:14:12.020 --> 00:14:15.290
I... talked to Wraith.

00:14:17.820 --> 00:14:19.070
In the car.

00:14:19.610 --> 00:14:22.670
It could have been a dream or an illusion.

00:14:23.270 --> 00:14:27.150
But they talked to me,
looking exactly as they did

00:14:27.150 --> 00:14:28.900
in that security camera footage.

00:14:29.590 --> 00:14:31.370
They said they wanted me.

00:14:31.370 --> 00:14:33.810
They said they need my ability.

00:14:34.200 --> 00:14:38.370
The Reflected will become one 
and make the world their own.

00:14:38.370 --> 00:14:40.550
They said that's what Darkness wants.

00:14:41.150 --> 00:14:42.560
Darkness?

00:14:43.060 --> 00:14:44.440
Do you know what that is?

00:14:45.010 --> 00:14:47.730
If Wraith likes you that much,

00:14:47.730 --> 00:14:50.450
they might stop by to say hi again.

00:14:50.450 --> 00:14:52.570
You don't believe me?

00:14:52.920 --> 00:14:57.580
No, I'm sure it's true. And that's 
why you're the perfect bait.

00:14:58.340 --> 00:14:59.340
Bait?

00:15:09.170 --> 00:15:10.790
What do you mean by "bait"?

00:15:10.790 --> 00:15:12.460
Just what it sounds like.

00:15:12.820 --> 00:15:15.360
Is that all you see me as?

00:15:15.650 --> 00:15:18.600
So I'll finally be useful to you?

00:15:19.810 --> 00:15:21.350
Where are you going?

00:15:21.350 --> 00:15:24.600
I won't be a good lure if I'm hiding, will I?

00:15:31.530 --> 00:15:33.690
Man, they got you good.

00:15:34.100 --> 00:15:36.860
But talk about a pain,

00:15:36.860 --> 00:15:40.480
needing three guys to get 
in and out of that suit.

00:15:40.480 --> 00:15:42.700
Don't you agree, Ian?

00:15:42.700 --> 00:15:45.210
Then I shouldn't even wear the thing!

00:15:46.030 --> 00:15:48.540
Huh? What's the matter?

00:15:50.390 --> 00:15:51.010
Ian!

00:15:51.960 --> 00:15:55.470
He said I'm a lighthouse 
that attracts the enemy.

00:15:57.590 --> 00:16:01.490
But I'm a hero. Everyone in 
this city thinks so, too.

00:16:01.780 --> 00:16:04.120
And yet... And yet...

00:16:04.120 --> 00:16:06.760
Is he saying I'm a clown 
meant to attract an audience?!

00:16:08.780 --> 00:16:12.450
Ian, don't let him get to you.

00:16:12.450 --> 00:16:14.250
You're doing a good job.

00:16:14.250 --> 00:16:16.290
Well, apparently I'm not!

00:16:16.290 --> 00:16:21.540
It's not like this is what 
I want to be doing, anyway!

00:16:21.820 --> 00:16:23.720
Now, now, Ian...

00:16:23.720 --> 00:16:26.190
I'm going back where I belong.

00:16:26.190 --> 00:16:30.540
Even if it's a dim light, 
I'll shine it on the audience.

00:16:43.010 --> 00:16:45.020
Street guitar player, huh?

00:16:48.790 --> 00:16:50.430
I'm a singer, damn it.

00:17:05.990 --> 00:17:07.730
You seem to be in a good mood.

00:17:07.730 --> 00:17:09.240
I am.

00:17:09.240 --> 00:17:12.940
It's rare for you to dig up your demo.

00:17:12.940 --> 00:17:15.680
I was remembering when I made this song.

00:17:16.010 --> 00:17:17.290
I see...

00:17:17.290 --> 00:17:19.670
Everything started from here.

00:17:20.210 --> 00:17:25.730
We all polished this song, nurtured it,
and I became a star.

00:17:26.330 --> 00:17:28.520
This seems a lot like back then.

00:17:30.570 --> 00:17:33.020
We're the best, aren't we?

00:17:33.020 --> 00:17:37.270
I envy how you can get so drunk 
off that watered-down scotch.

00:17:37.710 --> 00:17:39.810
Nah, I'm not drunk.

00:17:40.560 --> 00:17:41.530
Aaron...

00:17:41.830 --> 00:17:43.040
What is it?

00:17:44.100 --> 00:17:45.550
Never mind.

00:17:47.340 --> 00:17:48.840
I'm drunk.

00:17:54.150 --> 00:17:56.240
It wasn't a big deal.

00:17:57.320 --> 00:18:00.290
I just wanted to say that 
it was all thanks to you.

00:18:09.760 --> 00:18:12.230
I am Wraith.

00:18:13.570 --> 00:18:16.860
It's not much, but this is 
a token of my gratitude.

00:18:16.860 --> 00:18:20.320
I'm sure it's not a very 
impressive amount to you,

00:18:20.320 --> 00:18:22.520
but I wanted to thank you materially.

00:18:26.750 --> 00:18:30.080
You can turn off the lamp 
in the lighthouse now.

00:18:30.080 --> 00:18:32.700
You've done more than enough.

00:18:32.700 --> 00:18:35.260
You fulfilled many roles.

00:18:35.620 --> 00:18:37.580
I think it's about time you retire...

00:18:37.960 --> 00:18:39.630
From being a hero, that is.

00:18:40.540 --> 00:18:46.530
If you would like, you could 
leave your future to me.

00:18:46.810 --> 00:18:49.050
I need a fool...

00:18:49.050 --> 00:18:52.270
Someone who is empty and listens 
to orders, just like you.

00:18:52.270 --> 00:18:54.110
For Darkness.

00:18:54.420 --> 00:18:58.110
Stop talking nonsense in 
that ridiculous getup!

00:18:58.820 --> 00:19:01.740
Such lifeless words...

00:19:03.000 --> 00:19:07.330
I-Guy only exists because 
of his four attendants.

00:19:08.890 --> 00:19:13.050
I will welcome you at any time, Hollow King.

00:19:13.530 --> 00:19:15.130
What do you mean by that?

00:20:18.750 --> 00:20:21.830
<i>Ian... What are you, a kid?</i>

00:20:21.830 --> 00:20:24.000
<i>For crying out loud...</i>

00:20:24.000 --> 00:20:26.030
<i>Just forget about today.</i>

00:20:26.030 --> 00:20:29.280
<i>It's no big deal. No point 
in letting it get to you.</i>

00:20:29.280 --> 00:20:31.950
<i>We five ought to go even further.</i>

00:20:31.950 --> 00:20:36.090
<i>Jay, Tim, Enrico, and you and me.</i>

00:20:36.880 --> 00:20:39.330
<i>We can make anything possible.</i>

00:20:39.330 --> 00:20:42.690
<i>No, you can make anything possible, Ian.</i>

00:20:44.460 --> 00:20:47.100
<i>The four of us were just thinking...</i>

00:20:48.170 --> 00:20:54.240
<i>What's the point of a suit that 
takes all of us to get it on you?</i>

00:20:56.110 --> 00:21:00.110
<i>A hero should be able to transform on his own</i>

00:21:00.110 --> 00:21:03.610
<i>in a snap and appear quickly, 
or he'll look lame.</i>

00:21:12.490 --> 00:21:16.560
<i>That's why we made a version 2.</i>

00:21:17.350 --> 00:21:20.000
<i>I told you I had something you'd enjoy.</i>

00:21:20.430 --> 00:21:22.040
<i>Press that key.</i>

00:21:23.620 --> 00:21:28.340
<i>Ian, there's a reason we're 
bringing this thing out today.</i>

00:21:29.380 --> 00:21:32.950
<i>Don't you remember? Well, I do.</i>

00:21:32.950 --> 00:21:35.180
<i>It was thirty-odd years ago.</i>

00:21:35.180 --> 00:21:40.890
<i>It was around then that you let 
me hear the "Sky Show" demo.</i>

00:22:12.010 --> 00:22:15.230
<i>The first time I heard it, 
I knew it'd be a hit.</i>

00:22:15.230 --> 00:22:17.860
<i>That's why you're starting over again today.</i>

00:22:19.940 --> 00:22:24.230
<i>You lost your song, and your 
voice became a weapon.</i>

00:22:24.230 --> 00:22:26.590
<i>So you decided to become a hero.</i>

00:22:26.590 --> 00:22:29.570
<i>You have the ability to fly even higher.</i>

00:22:29.840 --> 00:22:33.050
<i>And yet you had to throw a fit and stomp out.</i>

00:22:33.050 --> 00:22:37.550
<i>Are you listening, Ian? 
Aaron made something amazing.</i>

00:22:37.550 --> 00:22:40.360
<i>Of course, we helped out, too!</i>

00:22:40.740 --> 00:22:44.900
<i>Ian, when you get back, 
take it for a test drive.</i>

00:24:45.000 --> 00:24:55.010
Next Time 
Beef or Fish

00:24:48.000 --> 00:24:55.010
Narration: Stan Lee
